'''''Lamentations, Bring Not Empty Tears''''' is a [[Trailblaze Mission]] in the chapter [[Light Slips the Gate, Shadow Greets the Throne]].

==Steps==
# Report back to Aglaea
# Send condolences to the victims' families
# Report back to Aglaea
# Speak with Castorice and Anaxa
# Return to your private bath chamber and end this day

